#: build-src/code/structure.md:5
msgid ""
"The root of the back end code is located at `src/main/java/fr/progilone/"
"pgcn`."
msgstr ""

#: build-src/code/structure.md:7
msgid ""
"The logic is split up in two ways. Firstly the logic is split vertically in "
"the stack by `repositories`, `services` and `controllers` (in ascending "
"order) these are stored inside folders in the root:"
msgstr ""

#: build-src/code/structure.md:8
msgid ""
"`repositories`: Abstraction of storage methods. Can be stored inside the "
"database or the file system."
msgstr ""

#: build-src/code/structure.md:9
msgid "`services`: Core of the business logic."
msgstr ""

#: build-src/code/structure.md:10
msgid ""
"`web`: REST API containing the controllers. Makes the interface to the front-"
"end."
msgstr ""

#: build-src/code/structure.md:13
msgid ""
"Then the logic is split horizontally by modules operating on a specific "
"primitives. Most of them are pretty straight forward. All the modules are:"
msgstr ""

#: build-src/code/structure.md:15
msgid "`es`: ElasticSearch module."
msgstr ""

#: build-src/code/structure.md:16
msgid ""
"`user`: users and their abilities (rights). The authentication is not "
"handled there."
msgstr ""

#: build-src/code/structure.md:17
msgid "`train`:"
msgstr ""

